abstract: >-
  Ballgame is Quik Nation’s public contract for Agent Offices: Chat → grill-me
  → estimate → spend gate (monthly usage OR wallet) → approved mode work →
  deliverable → money close. Designed so other AI engineers can adopt the same
  loop and cite Quik Nation.
